parts.text:
Need ensure `ng-if` on form with `id` referenced by aria-controls. Fine.

Now CSS. Need add styles. Need decide exact. Let's craft block. Should we use `.sequencia-painel .viewWindow-panel-container` flex. Add:
```
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .sequencia-painel { overflow: hidden; }
  .sequencia-painel .viewWindow-panel-container {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
}
.sequencia-painel .viewWindow-panel-container > h4:first-child {
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
```
Do we want override first h4 margin? Maybe keep 40/60. But list may be compressed. Better reduce margin for this panel? The current page title with 60 bottom plus cadastro section. Could be okay at 100vh. Let's calculate: top padding 70 + margin-top 40 + h4 line ~40 + margin-bottom 60 = 210. Cadastro header ~30 + margin 12 = 42. Divider ~25. Catalog title ~30. bottom padding 70. Total fixed ~377, leaving 391 at 768 height for list. Enough. At 600 height leaves 223. Fine. Could reduce h4 margin-bottom to 20 for this panel? Would improve. But not required. Plan says scoped spacing "título da seção não deve herdar margem grande"; page title remains. Fine.

Catalog:
```
.sequencia-cadastro { flex-shrink:0; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.sequencia-cadastro-titulo { margin:0 0 12px; font-size: 18px; }
.sequencia-cadastro-toggle { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; width:100%; padding:0; border:0; background:transparent; color:#fff; font:inherit; text-align:left; cursor:pointer; }
.sequencia-cadastro-toggle:hover, :focus { color:#fff; outline:none; }
.sequencia-cadastro-toggle:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #fff; outline-offset:4px; }
```
Need `h4` default font-weight 500, font-size 18px, Button font inherit. Fine.

Focus-visible support modern. Also `:focus` maybe. Use `:focus { outline: none; }` then focus-visible. Could be accessibility. Better `:focus-visible` only, default browser outline on focus if not removed. But button may have default outline on click. We can leave default focus, but design. Use:
```
.sequencia-cadastro-toggle:focus { color:#fff; }
.sequencia-cadastro-toggle:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #fff; outline-offset: 4px; }
```
No outline removal. Browser default outline maybe on click; okay.

Form controls:
```
.sequencia-cadastro .form-control {
  border:2px solid #fff;
  border-radius:4px;
  background:transparent;
  color:#fff;
  padding:10px;
}
.sequencia-cadastro .form-control::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); opacity:1; }
.sequencia-cadastro .form-control:focus { border-color:#fff; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
.sequencia-cadastro .help-block { color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); }
```
`form-group > .form-control` already border and background. Our scoped after will override.

Button:
```
.sequencia-cadastro-btn {
  background: transparent;
  border:2px solid #fff;
  border-radius:4px;
  color:#fff;
  padding:10px 22px;
  font-weight:600;
}
.sequencia-cadastro-btn:hover, .sequencia-cadastro-btn:focus {
  background:#fff; color:#BA007C;
}
.sequencia-cadastro-btn:disabled, .sequencia-cadastro-btn[disabled] {
  background:transparent; color:#fff; opacity:.6; cursor:not-allowed;
}
```
Order disabled after hover to override. Also `.btn:focus` maybe Bootstrap. Fine.
Could set `box-shadow:none`.

Messages:
```
.sequencia-cadastro-mensagem { margin: 12px 0 0; padding:10px 12px; border-radius:4px; }
.sequencia-cadastro-sucesso { background:#372478; color:#fff; }
.sequencia-cadastro-erro { background: rgba(55,36,120,.85)? or #fff? color white? }
```
Error should legible. Use `background:#372478; color:#FFE3E3`? That's same as success plus text. Or `background:#5A0C5E; color:#fff; border-left:4px solid #FFE3E3;` Maybe. Requirement only success high contrast. Use `background:#7B057E`? That's panel B. Hmm. For error, white text on dark purple too? Distinguish with border. Use `background: rgba(55,36,120,.9); color:#fff; border-left:4px solid #FFD1D1;`. But success same background. Better error `background:#5A0C5E` (darker) with white. Contrast likely >7. Could use `#6B0A6E`. But maybe simpler `background:#372478; color:#FFE3E3;`. It is legible. We'll use same background for both but success icons? Not needed.

Maybe success text not just background; `color: #fff; background: #372478;`. Error `background: #521052; color:#fff;` to differentiate. Need calculate contrast white on #521052 high. Fine.

Catalog:
```
.sequencia-divisor { border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35); margin: 0 0 18px; }
.sequencia-catalogo-titulo { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 18px; }
.sequencia-catalogo-erro { color:#FFE3E3; }
.sequencia-catalogo { min-height:0; overflow-y:auto; padding: 4px; margin: 0 -4px; }
```
If inside flex:
```
@media (min-width: 768px) {
 .sequencia-catalogo { flex: 1 1 auto; min-height:0; }
